  "install_text": "**Senstick Soil Moisture SSM40**\n\nLoRaWAN soil moisture sensor. Collects volumetric water content data.\n\n**Key features:**\n\n- LoRaWAN end-to-end encryption and data integrity protection\n- Monitors soil moisture as volumetric water content\n- Built in accelerometer for movement detection\n- Long battery life\n- Sealed probe and enclosure for underground and outdoor use\n- Optional pairing with an external soil probe for higher precision\n- Easily replaceable AA lithium battery\n- Can be configured remotely or locally with Senzemo app\n\nDASHBOARD: https://admin.tago.io/template/6a706054c197c9000ba4d2d9?host=api.eu-w1.tago.io",
  "device_annotation": "DASHBOARD: https://admin.tago.io/template/6a706054c197c9000ba4d2d9?host=api.eu-w1.tago.io",
